        	<li style="text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Univers,sans-serif"><span style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">The required number of bicycle parking spaces for allowed uses in Center and Corridor Zones is identified in Table 17C.230.200-2. If the calculated number of required bicycle parking spaces results in a decimal the required number of spaces is rounded up.</span></span></span></span></li>
        </ol>
        
