        		<tr>
        			<td colspan="2">
        			<p>Notes:<br />
        			[1] Electronic Message Center sign features are allowed in the GC, CC2, Downtown, CB, LI, HI O, OR, NR, NMU, &amp; CC1 zones if they meet the standards of <a href="https://my.spokanecity.org/smc/?Section=17C.240.240">SMC 17C.240.240</a>, Electronic Message Center Signs.<br />
        			[2] Electronic Message Center sign features are not allowed in the CC4 Zone</p>
